# Club Domain Rules

## Naming in this project

- The product DocType for members is **`Socio`** (Spanish). Skills that mention **Member** refer to the **domain concept**; implement links and permissions against **`Socio`** unless you are migrating names in a dedicated sprint.
- **Family / Grupo Familiar:** sibling and discount rules MUST use a **stable link** (`grupo_familiar`, **Family** DocType, or `parent_id`), never surname-only heuristics.

## Cost Centers (multi-unit)

Attribute revenue to **Sports | Gym | Restaurant | Rentals** (or site-defined Cost Centers) when touching money or reporting.

## Memberships

- Link memberships to **Subscription** (ERPNext or custom) when the feature requires billing periods.

## Socio estado and Vitalicio

- **`estado`** is read-only in UI; changes via **`validar_socio`**, correction flows, or automated **Vitalicio** rules—not free editing.
- **Vitalicio** after **25 years** from **`fecha_alta`**; **cuota** resolved as **0** for that category.

## Next sprint (reference)

Plan **“Socios categoría validación y panel Secretaría”**: cuota table in **Club Settings**, **Grupo Familiar**, **`fecha_alta`**, scheduled promotion to Vitalicio, Report + Workspace **Secretaría**, **`after_install`** default workspace for role **Secretaria**. Spec: **`club_management/specs/socios_categoria_validacion.md`** (paquete de la app; en Bench es `apps/club_management/club_management/specs/`).
